Not a particularly helpful suggestion, as most people do not manually=20
edit headers, nor even have the ability to do so.  Not with most email=20
client software, and certainly not with Outlook Express, which was used=20
to send the message you complain about.  Mutt and OE are worlds apart.

More helpful would be to suggest NOT using "reply" and then changing the=20
subject, since that is VERY likely how that field ended up in the header=20
of his message.

